OL,3,GNEWSAPolice attacked with fireworks and
OL,4,Abottles ahead of cup semi-final
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland officers were attacked
OL,7,Fwith fireworks and glass bottles ahead
OL,8,Fof the Rangers v Aberdeen league cup
OL,9,Fsemi-final.
OL,11,FThe disorder, which also involved
OL,12,F"other missiles", happened on Curtis
OL,13,FAvenue before the game at Hampden on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FSeveral officers were assaulted during
OL,17,Fthe "targeted" incident while two fans
OL,18,Fwere also hurt but did not require
OL,19,Fmedical attention.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
